of the current educational trends and future market demands; and 3) Promote grade-12 students\u2019 readiness for pursuing their higher degree. The number of the participants in this event was approximately 70 grade-12 students and some classroom teachers, and the event was held with strict observance of the guidelines from the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sport and the Ministry of Health to prevent the spread of Covid-19. The \u201cMajor and Career Counseling for Future Jobs\u201d is an important mission of CamTech in contributing with the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sport to raising the awareness and understanding of grade-12 students of how to select majors at higher education to respond to the current educational trends and future market demands in the era of Industrial Revolution 4.0 and ensure sustainable national economic development. CamTech would like to thank the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sport and the principal of Hun Sen Sa\u2019ang High School for allowing our team to have the opportunity to meet and consult with grade-12 students in a friendly atmosphere. This event provided many benefits to those grade 12 students in getting themselves prepared for their university life and the majors they should choose for higher education. Related Events<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":13278,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"elementor_header_footer","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[179],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-13280","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-news"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/13280","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camt